    [not_wired] scope-exclusion-obligation-code-only-evidence/override-skipped-on-other-construction-path
      The code_only override sits in one branch of `_obligations_from`. If an exclusion-derived obligation is built on another path (a fallback, a re-decomposition, or a merge of obligations), it never passes through this override and keeps the model's `code_and_tests` answer.
