    [scope_too_narrow] scope-exclusion-obligation-code-only-evidence/exclusion-section-not-detected-for-some-bullets
      The override is keyed on `requirement.section is RequirementSection.EXCLUSION`. A scope-exclusion bullet that the parse does not label EXCLUSION, such as a nested bullet, a differently worded or cased heading, or a bullet after a sub-heading, is treated as an ordinary requirement. Its obligation keeps the model's evidence judgement and may be owed tests.
