    [scope_too_narrow] scope-exclusion-same-evidence-same-status/mark-without-bullet-falls-back-to-wording
      When an exclusion obligation has no source_spans text, obligations_block emits a bare '(scope exclusion)' marker with no quoted bullet. The coverage stage then has nothing to judge against except the description wording, so a mis-worded exclusion can again be judged as work to do while its siblings are addressed.
