    [not_wired] scope-exclusion-same-evidence-same-status/status-consistency-left-to-model-judgement
      Equal status for equal evidence is only requested through prompt text (the mark plus an instruction). No code step after classification compares or normalises statuses across exclusion obligations in a run. The model can therefore still give one exclusion a different status from a sibling with the same evidence, for example not_addressed on a positively worded one, or non-empty diff_refs.
