    [unenforced_on_one_path] scope-exclusion-same-evidence-same-status/exclusion-evidence-override-not-on-every-construction-path
      The code_only override and the fixed reason are applied only inside _obligations_from. If an exclusion obligation reaches the review by another route (a re-decomposition, merge, or reload that builds Obligation directly), it keeps the model's code_and_tests requirement. Such an exclusion would then be owed tests, and could be reported not addressed while a sibling with the same code evidence is addressed.
